OL,3,AVinted blocks French looters listing
OL,4,Astolen goods for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,FVinted says it has removed listings of
OL,7,Fitems believed to have been looted from
OL,8,Fshops during the ongoing riots in
OL,9,FFrance.
OL,11,FThe second hand re-selling platform
OL,12,Fsaid following the weekend's disorder
OL,13,Fit had "taken immediate action to
OL,14,Fidentify and remove listings linked to
OL,15,Flooting".
OL,17,FShops across several French cities were
OL,18,Fbroken into and ransacked during the
OL,19,Foutbreak of riots over the weekend.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,113,105,200,300,0,100
