OL,3,AVinted blocks French looters listing
OL,4,Astolen goods for sale
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The sale of stolen goods, or
OL,7,Fsoliciting them, is strictly prohibited
OL,8,Fon Vinted, and we have zero tolerance
OL,9,Ffor it," a spokesperson for the company
OL,10,Fsaid.
